  "description": "The original adult minotaur: upright muscular bull-headed humanoid, dark gray-brown bare chest and arms, shaggy dark brown mane down the back, furry brown bent legs with black split hooves. Small fierce red eyes, black broad bovine muzzle and bright gold nose ring. Two large pale gray ivory horns curve sideways then upward with reddish brown tips. Short ragged olive-green hide skirt and matching green wrist guards with gold rims and white spikes; gold belt with small blue inset details. One original long brown wooden haft with ornate bronze double crescent axe head, bright silver cutting edges and central narrow spike, held at the native angle and size. Preserve narrow waist, native head and horn proportions, handedness and equipment; no armor or additional weapons. Only olive-green skirt and wrist guard material changes to teal and crimson in variants; fur, skin, horns, gold and axe remain protected.",
